          "_name": "image08",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image08\" group=\"Image & Video\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#2e481a\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n          <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Leaves of Fate</b></h5>\n          <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Leaves of Fate is a zany, feel-good 2D platformer with fluid movement and strong narrative themes. Float around your foes with Fenn's leafy dash and toss obstacles aside with Az's forceful strength. Get through to the evil wizards and save the Great Knights of the realm.</h6>\n          <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://projectmisfits.github.io/\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Visit the Website</a></div>\n          <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3  main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://projectmisfits.github.io/releases/\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Download the Game</a></div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features\">\n        <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-4\">\n          <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gamelogo-1.png\" alt=\"Leaves of Fate\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "image08-3p",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vdFDLPKvhT",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                <b>Framing time</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Leaves of Fate<br>January - March 2026<br><br>Over the course of several months, I worked with the Project Misfits team as a contractor to create assets for their game <i>Leaves of Fate, </i>a 2D platformer developed over the course of seven weeks.<br><br>Tools used: Godot, Adobe Animate</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vdFyo8JoFC",
          "_anchor": "article12-3e",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "((@paddingBottom * 1rem) - 2rem)",
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              "padding-bottom": "((@paddingBottom * 1rem) - 1rem)"
            },
            "img, .item-img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "& when (@autoSize)": {
                "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                "object-fit": "cover"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 1200px)": {
              "img, .item-img": {
                "& when (@autoSize)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 75px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                }
              }
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".main-button": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text UL": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle, .main-button": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".side-features": {
              "display": "-webkit-flex",
              "-webkit-flex-wrap": "wrap",
              "padding-left": "0px",
              "padding-right": "0px",
              ".item": {
                "padding-left": "16px",
                "padding-right": "16px"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-flow": "column nowrap",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".item-title": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "& when not (@spacing)": {
              ".item-wrapper": {
                "padding": "0",
                "margin": "0"
              },
              ".side-features .item": {
                "padding-left": "0px",
                "padding-right": "0px"
              },
              ".side-features": {
                "padding-left": "16px",
                "padding-right": "16px"
              }
            },
            ".item-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".main-text": {
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "padding-left": "0",
                "padding-right": "32px",
                "& when (@reverseContent)": {
                  "padding-left": "32px",
                  "padding-right": "0"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "gallery09",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"gallery09\" group=\"Gallery & Slider\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButton\" title=\"Buttons\">\n    <header>Gallery</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Captions\">\n    <select title=\"Image Width\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n      <option value=\"4\">Narrow</option>\n      <option value=\"6\" selected>Wide</option>\n    </select>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n    </fieldset>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4 main-text\">\n        <div class>\n          <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Character Animations: Az</b></h5>\n          <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">I was the character artist and animator for Az, a companion character in the game. I was responsible for developing the final look of the character based on concept art, and creating her idle and walk animations.</h6>\n          <div class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3 main-button\" mbr-if=\"showButton\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"page4.html\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">See more details</a></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-lg-8 side-features row\">\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/az-idle-1.gif\" alt=\"Az Idle\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                <b>Innovation</b>\n              </h5>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n              <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/az-walk-7.gif\" alt=\"Az Walk\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content align-left\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                <b>Support</b>\n              </h5>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
